   properties: {\n                      url: { type: \"string\" },\n                      title: { type: \"string\" },\n                      snippet: { type: \"string\" },\n                      publishedAt: { type: \"string\" },\n                    },\n                  },\n                },\n                meta: UNCERTAINTY_SCHEMA,\n              },\n            },\n            render(args, value) {\n              const lines = value.sources.map((s, i) => `- [${s.title ?? s.url}](${s.url})${s.snippet ? ` - ${s.snippet}` : \"\"}${s.publishedAt ? ` (${s.publishedAt})` : \"\"}`);\n              const note = value.content ? String(value.content).trim() : \"\";\n              // 空结果时区分「真的没搜到」与「引擎出错」：有 note（失败原因等）就展示，而不是谎报 No results\n              const body = lines.length > 0 ? `${lines.join(\"\\n\")}${note ? `\\n\\n${note}` : \"\"}` : note || \"No results found.\";\n              const uncertainty = value.meta?.uncertainty;\n              const confidence =\n                uncertainty && uncertainty.level !== \"high\"\n                  ? `\\n\\nConfidence: ${uncertainty.level}${Array.isArray(uncertainty.notes) && uncertainty.notes.length > 0 ? ` — ${uncertainty.notes.join(\"; \")}` : \"\"}`\n                  : \"\";\n              return [{ type: \"text\", text: `Search (${value.provider}${args.timeRange ? `, timeRange=${args.timeRange}` : \"\"}):\\n${wrapUntrustedBlock(body)}${confidence}` }];\n            },\n          },\n          async execute(args) {\n            if (!args.query || !String(args.query).trim()) throw new Error(\"query is required\");\n            const request = {\n              query: args.query,\n              maxResults: Math.min(args.maxResults ?? 5, 10),\n            };\n            if (parseTimeRange(args.timeRange) !== undefined) request.timeRange = args.timeRange;\n            // engine 指定时：仅当该引擎可用才优先（仍走回退链，失败自动换引擎）\n            if (args.engine && (ALL_ENGINES.includes(args.engine) || args.engine === \"auto\" || args.engine === \"multi\")) request.engine = args.engine;\n            const result = await provider.search(request);\n            // lossless JSON 不允许 undefined 字段：按存在的值构造对象，缺字段直接省略\n            return {\n              provider: result.provider || result._provider || autoDefaultProvider,\n              content: typeof result.content === \"string\" ? result.content : \"\",\n              sources: (result.sources ?? []).map((s) => {\n                const source = {};\n                if (s.url !== undefined && s.url !== null && s.url !== \"\") source.url = s.url;\n                if (s.title !== undefined && s.title !== null && s.title !== \"\") source.title = String(s.title);\n                if (s.snippet !== undefined && s.snippet !== null && s.snippet !== \"\") source.snippet = String(s.snippet);\n                if (s.publishedAt !== undefined && s.publishedAt !== null && s.publishedAt !== \"\") {\n                  source.publishedAt = String(s.publishedAt);\n                }\n                return source;\n              }),\n              meta: {\n                uncertainty: assessUncertainty({\n                  promptLanguage: current().promptLanguage,\n                  sources: result.sources ?? [],\n                  timeRange: Boolean(request.timeRange),\n                  note: typeof result.content === \"string\" ? result.content : \"\",\n                  lang: configLanguage(current()),\n                }),\n              },\n            };\n          },\n          finalizeContent(exec, result) {\n            // render 已直接返回 block 数组；这里保留为幂等兜底\n            const text = result.content;\n            return typeof text === \"string\" && text.length > 0 ? [{ type: \"text\", text }] : undefined;\n          },\n        })\n      );\n      return () => {\n        dispose();\n      };\n    } });\n  });\n\n  // 多源并发合并搜索工具：并发请求多个引擎并交叉合并去重\n  ctx.inject([\"tools\"], (sctx) => {\n    localizedEffect(sctx, {\n      label: \"free-search: multi search tool\",\n      ns: FREE_SEARCH_NS,\n      getLang: () => promptLanguageOf(current()),\n      getEnabled: () => toolEnabled(\"multi_search\"),\n      getKey: () => String(normalizeMultiMaxResults(current().multiMaxResults)),\n      register: (lang) => {\n      const dispose = sctx.tools.register(\n        defineTool({\n          name: \"multi_search\",\n          description: toolDescription(lang, \"multi_search\"),\n          parameters: {\n            query: {\n              type: \"string\",\n              description: toolParam(lang, \"multi_search\", \"query\"),\n            },\n            maxResults: {\n              type: \"number\",\n              description: toolParam(lang, \"multi_search\", \"maxResults\", {\n                limit: normalizeMultiMaxResults(current().multiMaxResults),\n              }),\n            },\n            engines: {\n              type: \"array\",\n              description: toolParam(lang, \"multi_search\", \"engines\"),\n              items: { type: \"string\" },\n            },\n          },\n          output: {\n            schema: {\n              type: \"object\",\n              additionalProperties: false,\n              properties: {\n                provider: { type: \"string\" },\n                content: { type: \"string\" },\n                sources: {\n                  type: \"array\",\n                  items: {\n                    type: \"object\",\n                    additionalProperties: false,\n                    properties: {\n                      url: { type: \"string\" },\n                      title: { type: \"string\" },\n                      snippet: { type: \"string\" },\n                      publishedAt: { type: \"string\" },\n                      seenIn: {\n                        type: \"array\",\n                        items: { type: \"string\" },\n                      },\n                    },\n                  },\n                },\n                meta: UNCERTAINTY_SCHEMA,\n              },\n            },\n            render(args, value) {\n              const lines = value.sources.map((s) => {\n                const seenStr = Array.isArray(s.seenIn) && s.seenIn.length > 0 ? ` [seen in: ${s.seenIn.join(\", \")}]` : \"\";\n                return `- [${s.title ?? s.url}](${s.url})${seenStr}${s.snippet ? ` - ${s.snippet}` : \"\"}${s.publishedAt ? ` (${s.publishedAt})` : \"\"}`;\n              });\n              const note = value.content ? String(value.content).trim() : \"\";\n              // 空结果时区分「真的没搜到」与「引擎出错」：有 note（失败原因等）就展示，而不是谎报 No results\n              const body = lines.length > 0 ? `${lines.join(\"\\n\")}${note ? `\\n\\n${note}` : \"\"}` : note || \"No results found.\";\n              const uncertainty = value.meta?.uncertainty;\n              const confidence =\n                uncertainty && uncertainty.level !== \"high\"\n                  ? `\\n\\nConfidence: ${uncertainty.level}${Array.isArray(uncertainty.notes) && uncertainty.notes.length > 0 ? ` — ${uncertainty.notes.join(\"; \")}` : \"\"}`\n                  : \"\";\n              return [{ type: \"text\", text: `Multi-Search (${value.provider}):\\n${wrapUntrustedBlock(body)}${confidence}` }];\n            },\n          },\n          async execute(args) {\n            const result = await runMultiSearch({\n              query: args.query,\n              maxResults: args.maxResults,\n              engines: args.engines,\n            });\n            // runMultiSearch is shared with the default Multi Search web_search mode,\n            // where SearchProvider may use `truncated`. The tool schema is strict\n            // (additionalProperties: false), so expose only declared tool fields here.\n            const { truncated: _truncated, ...toolResult } = result;\n            return {\n              ...toolResult,\n              meta: {\n                uncertainty: assessUncertainty({\n                  // #92: 和 advanced_search 一个口径——少了这行，promptLanguage: zh + lang: ja 时\n                  // 这里会按 outputLanguage(\"ja\") 回落成英文，同一个会话两套置信度说明\n                  promptLanguage: current().promptLanguage,\n                  sources: toolResult.sources ?? [],\n                  note: typeof toolResult.content === \"string\" ? toolResult.content : \"\",\n                  lang: configLanguage(current()),\n                }),\n              },\n            };\n          },\n          finalizeContent(exec, result) {\n            const text = result.content;\n            return typeof text === \"string\" && text.length > 0 ? [{ type: \"text\", text }] : undefined;\n          },\n        })\n      );\n      return () => {\n        dispose();\n      };\n    } });\n  });\n\n  // 一次性研究工具（#59）：多引擎路由搜索 + 分层抓取正文 + 重排选窗 + Markdown 证据包。\n  // escalationEngines：质量升级池配置 getter（volatile 配置运行期可变，逐次解析）。\n  registerResearchTool(ctx, { provider, resolveApiKey, wrapUntrustedBlock, escalationEngines: () => current().escalationEngines, getConfig: current, ns: FREE_SEARCH_NS, isToolDisabled: (id) => !toolEnabled(id) });\n\n  // 垂直领域源直查：domain_search 工具 + 免 key 领域引擎注册表。\n  registerDomainSearchTool(ctx, { wrapUntrustedBlock, getConfig: current, ns: FREE_SEARCH_NS, isToolDisabled: (id) => !toolEnabled(id) });\n\n  // 给 agent 注入精简、动态的搜索能力说明。禁用引擎不会出现在提示词中。\n  ctx.inject([\"systemPrompt\"], (sctx) => {\n    let disposeSection = null;\n    refreshPrompt = () => {\n      if (disposeSection) { disposeSection(); disposeSection = null; }\n      const cfg = current();\n      // #102：三段拼起来就是注入内容；拼装出错要报出来，不能静默少一段。\n      let injected = \"\";\n      try {\n        injected = composeInjectedPrompt(cfg);\n      } catch (error) {\n        logger.warn(`free-search: could not build the prompt section (${error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error)})`);\n        return;\n      }\n      if (!injected) return;\n      disposeSection = sctx.systemPrompt.section({ name: \"free-search:engines\", order: 500, text: injected });\n    };\n    sctx.effect(() => { refreshPrompt(); return () => { if (disposeSection) disposeSection(); disposeSection = null; }; }, \"free-search: dynamic compact engine prompt\");\n  });\n}\n\nexport { degoogSearchUrl } from \"./engines/degoog.js\";\n\nexport {\n  isFirecrawlKeylessRefusal,\n  isFirecrawlKeylessBlocked,\n  splitApiKeys,\n  markFirecrawlKeylessBlocked,\n  acceptLanguageFor,\n  setActiveAcceptLanguage,\n  searchLanguage,\n  configLanguage,\n  outputLanguage,\n  setActiveOutputLanguage,\n  getActiveOutputLanguage,\n} from \"./engines/shared.js\";\n\nexport {\n  ALL_ENGINES,\n  isBridgeRequestAllowed,\n  EXPLICIT_ONLY_ENGINES,\n  assertSchemasterySupportsVolatile,\n  COOLDOWN_SESSION_MS,\n  engineCooldowns,\n  classifyFailure,\n  FAILURE_CLASSES,\n  DEFAULT_FALLBACK_ON,\n  normalizeFallbackOn,\n  DEFAULT_FALLBACK_ORDER,\n  enabledEngines,\n  hasCustomFallbackOrder,\n  normalizeDisabledEngines,\n  normalizeAllowedEngines,\n  normalizeMultiMaxResults,\n  multiResultLimit,\n  MULTI_RESULTS_MAX,\n  cleanSnippet,\n  compareVersions,\n  detectInstallMode,\n  fetchLatestVersion,\n  effectiveDisabledEngines,\n  normalizeFallbackOrder,\n  ANYSEARCH_URL,\n  BING_URL,\n  Config,\n  DDG_HTML_URL,\n  DDG_LITE_URL,\n  EXA_MCP_URL,\n  FIRECRAWL_URL,\n  FREE_ENGINES,\n  FREE_SEARCH_NS,\n  KEENABLE_MCP_URL,\n  KEENABLE_URL,\n  PARALLEL_URL,\n  PLATFORMS,\n  SEARXNG_INSTANCES,\n  TAVILY_URL,\n  TIME_ENGINES,\n  TIME_RANGES,\n  apply,\n  approximateTimeRange,\n  formatKeenableRelative,\n  inject,\n  name,\n  parseTimeRange,\n  routeEngines,\n  searchAnysearch,\n  searchAliyun,\n  searchDoubao,\n  searchOpenai,\n  searchGemini,\n  searchClaude,\n  searchBaidu,\n  searchKimi,\n  searchBing,\n  searchBilibili,\n  searchDeepSeekOfficial,\n  searchDeepSeekTools,\n  searchDdgHtml,\n  searchDdgLite,\n  searchExa,\n  searchExaMCP,\n  searchFirecrawl,\n  searchGithub,\n  searchHackerNews,\n  searchKeenable,\n  searchKeenableMCP,\n  searchKeenableREST,\n  searchNpm,\n  searchParallel,\n  searchPerplexity,\n  searchPlatform,\n  searchReddit,\n  searchSearxng,\n  searchSerpbase,\n  searchSerply,\n  searchOutcrawl,\n  searchGoogle,\n  searchTinyfish,\n  searchJina,\n  searchYoucom,\n  resolveYoucomApiKey,\n  YOUCOM_FREE_URL,\n  YOUCOM_URL,\n  searchZhihuGlobal,\n  searchZhihuSite,\n  ZHIHU_MCP_URL,\n  searchStackOverflow,\n  searchTavily,\n  searchV2ex,\n  searchWikipedia,\n  searchBingVideos,\n  searchDdgVideos,\n  searchYoutube,\n  searchVimeo,\n  stripBoundaryTags,\n  stripZhihuTracking,\n  wrapUntrustedBlock,\n};\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "lib/fetch_provider.js",
      "content": "// 质量链 fetch provider：接管宿主 web_fetch（替代基础 http provider）。\n// T1 直连（跟随重定向，仅文本类内容）→ T2 exa contents（$1/1000 页，清洗正文 markdown，文本质量好且便宜）\n// → T3 firecrawl（Markdown，反爬/JS/PDF）→ T4 crawl4ai（Markdown 备份）。\n// firecrawl 额度保护：仅在前层（直连/exa）失败时才走；exa 失败静默降级不抛。\n// 契约：WebFetchResult { url, statusCode, body: {kind:'html'|'text', content}, truncated }（CLOSED 联合类型）。\n// ponytail: 无服务级令牌桶——web_fetch 为单发用户/agent 驱动调用，非扇出；若未来批量调用再引入共享调度。\n\nimport https from \"node:https\";\nimport zlib from \"node:zlib\";\nimport { spawn } from \"node:child_process\";\nimport { existsSync, mkdtempSync, rmSync } from \"node:fs\";\nimport { tmpdir } from \"node:os\";\nimport { join } from \"node:path\";\nimport { callExa, callFirecrawl, callCrawl4ai } from \"./fetch_upstream.js\";\nimport { stripLoneSurrogates } from \"./safe_text.js\";\nimport { assertPublicUrl, makeSafeLookup } from \"./ssrf.js\";\n\nconst T1_MIN_CHARS = 300;\nconst TEXTUAL = /text\\/|json|xml|javascript|application\\/json/i;\n\n// ---------- T1.5：系统浏览器无头渲染（执行 JS 过挑战；无浏览器/失败/超时则静默跳过） ----------\nconst BROWSER_CANDIDATES = [\n  \"C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\Microsoft\\\\Edge\\\\Application\\\\msedge.exe\",\n  \"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Microsoft\\\\Edge\\\\Application\\\\msedge.exe\",\n  \"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Google\\\\Chrome\\\\Application\\\\chrome.exe\",\n  \"C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\Google\\\\Chrome\\\\Application\\\\chrome.exe\",\n  \"/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome\",\n  \"/Applications/Microsoft Edge.app/Contents/MacOS/Microsoft Edge\",\n];\nlet cachedBrowserPath; // undefined = 未检测；null = 无浏览器\nfunction findSystemBrowser() {\n  if (cachedBrowserPath !== undefined) return cachedBrowserPath;\n  cachedBrowserPath = null;\n  for (const p of BROWSER_CANDIDATES) {\n    try {\n      if (existsSync(p)) {\n        cachedBrowserPath = p;\n        break;\n      }\n    } catch {\n      // 忽略检测错误\n    }\n  }\n  return cachedBrowserPath;\n}\n\nfunction browserDumpDom(browserPath, url, { timeoutMs = 25000, signal } = {}) {\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\n    // 独立 user-data-dir：避免与用户正在运行的浏览器实例抢同一 profile（共享 profile 时无输出/立即退出）\n    let tmpDir;\n    let child;\n    try {\n      tmpDir = mkdtempSync(join(tmpdir(), \"dshfs-browser-\"));\n      child = spawn(browserPath, [\n        \"--headless=new\",\n        \"--disable-gpu\",\n        \"--no-first-run\",\n        \"--no-sandbox\",\n        // 抑制崩溃上报/组件更新/账号同步：Windows 实测这些会在 tmp profile 下反复报错\n        // （Crashpad settings.dat 写入失败、get_updates failed）并偶发导致退出码异常/无输出\n        \"--disable-breakpad\",\n        \"--disable-crashpad\",\n        \"--disable-component-update\",\n        \"--disable-sync\",\n        `--user-data-dir=${tmpDir}`,\n        \"--dump-dom\",\n        \"--virtual-time-budget=10000\",\n        url,\n        // POSIX 下让浏览器自立进程组：killTree 才能整组杀（渲染子进程随组一起走），\n        // 也不会被宿主的 Ctrl+C 误伤（浏览器生命周期由本函数自己管）。\n      ], { stdio: [\"ignore\", \"pipe\", \"pipe\"], windowsHide: true, detached: process.platform !== \"win32\" });\n    } catch {\n      if (tmpDir) try { rmSync(tmpDir, { recursive: true, force: true }); } catch { /* 忽略 */ }\n      resolve(null);\n      return;\n    }\n    let out = \"\";\n    let done = false;\n    // 杀整棵进程树：Edge/Chrome 是多进程架构，child.kill() 只杀主进程会残留渲染子进程\n    // (#74) taskkill 只存在于 Windows；POSIX 走独立进程组整组 SIGKILL。\n    //      另：spawn 的失败是异步 'error' 事件，同步 try/catch 抓不到——不挂监听器会升级成\n    //      uncaughtException 把 dsh 宿主整个带走，所以 taskkill 必须挂 on(\"error\") 并 unref。\n    const killTree = () => {\n      const fallback = () => { try { child.kill(\"SIGKILL\"); } catch { /* 忽略 */ } };\n      if (process.platform !== \"win32\") {\n        try { process.kill(-child.pid, \"SIGKILL\"); } // 组已退出时 ESRCH，交给 fallback\n        catch { fallback(); }\n        return;\n      }\n      try {\n        const killer = spawn(\"taskkill\", [\"/pid\", String(child.pid), \"/T\", \"/F\"], { windowsHide: true, stdio: \"ignore\" });\n        killer.on(\"error\", fallback);\n        killer.unref();\n      } catch {\n        fallback();\n      }\n    };\n    const finish = (ok) => {\n      if (done) return;\n      done = true;\n      killTree();\n      if (tmpDir) {\n        // 浏览器进程退出后才能删 profile 目录；延迟清理，失败无所谓\n        setTimeout(() => { try { rmSync(tmpDir, { recursive: true, force: true }); } catch { /* 忽略 */ } }, 500);\n      }\n      resolve(ok && out.length > 0 ? out : null);\n    };\n    child.stdout.on(\"data\", (c) => {\n      if (out.length < 5 * 1024 * 1024) out += c.toString(\"utf8\");\n    });\n    // stderr 必须 pipe 且读取丢弃：Windows 上 Edge 无头模式 stderr 指向 NUL 会卡死（实测 exit=1/0 输出）\n    child.stderr.on(\"data\", () => {});\n    child.on(\"error\", () => finish(false));\n    // 以 exit 为准：Edge/Chrome 的渲染子进程会继承 stdout pipe，\"close\" 可能迟迟不触发；\n    // 稍等 200ms 让残余数据 flush 到齐（exit 与 stdout 到达之间有窗口）。\n    child.on(\"exit\", (code) => {\n      setTimeout(() => finish(code === 0 || out.length > 0), 200);\n    });\n    setTimeout(() => finish(false), timeoutMs);\n    if (signal) {\n      if (signal.aborted) finish(false);\n      else signal.addEventListener(\"abort\", () => finish(false), { once: true });\n    }\n  });\n}\n\n// #88：按声明的 charset 解码。GBK/GB2312/Big5/Shift_JIS 老站很常见，\n// 一律当 UTF-8 会得到整页 \\uFFFD，而且不会报错、不会降级，模型直接吃一页乱码。\nfunction parseCharset(contentType) {\n  const match = /charset\\s*=\\s*\"?([^\";\\s]+)\"?/i.exec(String(contentType || \"\"));\n  return match ? match[1].trim().toLowerCase() : \"\";\n}\n\nfunction sniffHtmlCharset(buffer) {\n  const head = buffer.subarray(0, 2048).toString(\"latin1\");\n  let match = /<meta[^>]+charset\\s*=\\s*[\"']?\\s*([\\w.:-]+)/i.exec(head);\n  if (match) return match[1].toLowerCase();\n  match = /<meta[^>]+content\\s*=\\s*[\"'][^\"']*charset\\s*=\\s*([\\w.:-]+)/i.exec(head);\n  return match ? match[1].toLowerCase() : \"\";\n}\n\nfunction decodeBody(buffer, contentType) {\n  let label = parseCharset(contentType);\n  if (!label && /html|xml/i.test(String(contentType || \"\"))) label = sniffHtmlCharset(buffer);\n  if (!label) label = \"utf-8\";\n  try {\n    return new TextDecoder(label, { fatal: false }).decode(buffer);\n  } catch {\n    // 无法识别的 label（或该 Node 没编进对应编码表）：退回 UTF-8，不抛错。\n    return buffer.toString(\"utf8\");\n  }\n}\n\n/** GET 跟随重定向（≤5 跳），返回最终 URL / 状态 / 正文 / 内容类型；支持 gzip/br/deflate 解压。 */\nexport function httpsGetFollow(url, { headers = {}, timeoutMs = 20000, signal, lookup } = {}, transport = https) {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    let settled = false;\n    let activeReq = null;\n    let activeRes = null;\n    let activeStream = null;\n\n    const cleanup = () => {\n      if (signal) signal.removeEventListener(\"abort\", onAbort);\n    };\n    const settle = (ok, value) => {\n      if (settled) return;\n      settled = true;\n      cleanup();\n      if (ok) resolve(value);\n      else reject(value);\n    };\n    const destroyActive = () => {\n      for (const target of [activeStream, activeRes, activeReq]) {\n        try {\n          target?.destroy?.(new Error(\"aborted\"));\n        } catch {\n          // 忽略清理失败\n        }\n      }\n    };\n    const onAbort = () => {\n      destroyActive();\n      settle(false, signal?.reason instanceof Error ? signal.reason : new Error(\"aborted\"));\n    };\n\n    if (signal) {\n      if (signal.aborted) {\n        settle(false, new Error(\"aborted\"));\n        return;\n      }\n      signal.addEventListener(\"abort\", onAbort, { once: true });\n    }\n\n    const hop = (current, left) => {\n      if (settled) return;\n      let target;\n      try {\n        target = new URL(current);\n      } catch (error) {\n        settle(false, error);\n        return;\n      }\n      const req = transport.request(\n        {\n          hostname: target.hostname,\n          port: target.port || (target.protocol === \"http:\" ? 80 : 443),\n          path: target.pathname + target.search,\n          method: \"GET\",\n          headers,\n          timeout: timeoutMs,\n          ...(lookup ? { lookup } : {}),\n        },\n        (res) => {\n          activeRes = res;\n          if ([301, 302, 303, 307, 308].includes(res.statusCode) && res.headers.location && left > 0) {\n            res.resume();\n            return hop(new URL(res.headers.location, current).toString(), left - 1);\n          }\n\n          const enc = String(res.headers[\"content-encoding\"] || \"\").toLowerCase();\n          let stream = res;\n          try {\n            if (enc.includes(\"br\")) stream = res.pipe(zlib.createBrotliDecompress());\n            else if (enc.includes(\"gzip\")) stream = res.pipe(zlib.createGunzip());\n            else if (enc.includes(\"deflate\")) stream = res.pipe(zlib.createInflate());\n          } catch {\n            stream = res;\n          }\n          activeStream = stream;\n\n          const chunks = [];\n          // 压缩响应的解压流感知不到上游 res 的销毁：pipe 不转发 error/close，\n          // 对端中途断连时解压流既不 end 也不 error，Promise 会永久挂起（#87）。\n          // 因此 body 的失败必须从 res 侧判定，并主动销毁解压流。\n          const bodyGone = (reason) => {\n            if (settled) return;\n            try {\n              stream.destroy?.();\n            } catch {\n              // 忽略\n            }\n            settle(false, reason instanceof Error ? reason : new Error(String(reason)));\n          };\n          res.on(\"aborted\", () => bodyGone(new Error(\"connection aborted while reading the response body\")));\n          res.on(\"error\", (error) => bodyGone(error));\n          res.on(\"close\", () => {\n            if (!res.complete) bodyGone(new Error(\"connection closed before the response body completed\"));\n          });\n\n          stream.on(\"data\", (chunk) => chunks.push(chunk));\n          stream.on(\"end\", () =>\n            settle(true, {\n              url: current,\n              status: res.statusCode,\n              text: decodeBody(Buffer.concat(chunks), res.headers[\"content-type\"] || \"\"),\n              contentType: res.headers[\"content-type\"] || \"\",\n            })\n          );\n          stream.on(\"error\", (error) => settle(false, error));\n        }\n      );\n      activeReq = req;\n      req.on(\"timeout\", () => {\n        req.destroy(new Error(`timeout after ${timeoutMs}ms`));\n        settle(false, new Error(`timeout after ${timeoutMs}ms`));\n      });\n      req.on(\"error\", (error) => settle(false, error));\n      req.end();\n    };\n\n    try {\n      hop(url, 5);\n    } catch (error) {\n      settle(false, error);\n    }\n  });\n}\n\n// 完整浏览器请求头（Chrome 128 形态）：部分反爬站（如百度系）对精简头直接 403，完整头可通过。\n// Accept-Language 不在这里：它跟随 lang（#92），由调用方逐次传入，否则日语环境抓到的仍是中文版页面。\n// 注意：声明了 Accept-Encoding 就必须解压（httpsGetFollow 已支持 gzip/br/deflate）。\nconst BROWSERISH = {\n  \"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/128.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\",\n  Accept: \"text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/avif,image/webp,image/apng,*/*;q=0.8\",\n  \"Accept-Encoding\": \"gzip, deflate, br\",\n  \"sec-ch-ua\": '\"Chromium\";v=\"128\", \"Not;A=Brand\";v=\"24\", \"Google Chrome\";v=\"128\"',\n  \"sec-ch-ua-mobile\": \"?0\",\n  \"sec-ch-ua-platform\": '\"Windows\"',\n  \"Sec-Fetch-Dest\": \"document\",\n  \"Sec-Fetch-Mode\": \"navigate\",\n  \"Sec-Fetch-Site\": \"none\",\n  \"Sec-Fetch-User\": \"?1\",\n  \"Upgrade-Insecure-Requests\": \"1\",\n};\n\n/** 请求头：Accept-Language 跟随调用方（#92），其余固定为浏览器形态。 */\nexport function browserishHeaders(acceptLanguage = \"en-US,en;q=0.9\") {\n  return { ...BROWSERISH, \"Accept-Language\": String(acceptLanguage ?? \"\").trim() || \"en-US,en;q=0.9\" };\n}\nexport function createFetchProvider({\n  resolveApiKey,\n  logger,\n  acceptLanguage = () => \"en-US,en;q=0.9\",\n  browserEnabled = () => true,\n  prefer = () => \"exa\",\n  allowedCidrs = () => [],\n  validateUrl = assertPublicUrl,\n}) {\n  return {\n    id: \"fs-quality-fetch\",\n    /** 廉价本地可用性检查（seam 契约要求，禁止网络调用）。 */\n    available() { return true; },\n    async fetch(request, signal) {\n      const url = String(request?.url || \"\");\n      if (!/^https:\\/\\//i.test(url)) throw new Error(`fs-quality-fetch: only https URLs are supported (got \"${url.slice(0, 60)}\")`);\n      // SSRF guard: never fetch loopback / private / metadata addresses, and use a\n      // lookup that re-checks every redirect hop. Explicitly allowed CIDRs cover\n      // transparent-proxy fake-ip ranges (Clash/mihomo 198.18.0.0/15).\n      const allowed = allowedCidrs();\n      await validateUrl(url, { allowedCidrs: allowed });\n      const errors = [];\n\n      // T1：直连（文本类内容；二进制交给后层——exa 取正文，PDF 等仍由 firecrawl 处理）\n      try {\n        const r = await httpsGetFollow(url, { headers: browserishHeaders(acceptLanguage()), signal, lookup: makeSafeLookup(allowed) });\n        if (r.status < 400 && TEXTUAL.test(r.contentType) && r.text.length >= T1_MIN_CHARS) {\n          return { url: r.url, statusCode: r.status, body: { kind: \"html\", content: stripLoneSurrogates(r.text) }, truncated: false };\n        }\n        if (r.status >= 400) errors.push(`direct HTTP ${r.status}`);\n        else errors.push(`direct: ${r.contentType || \"unknown type\"} ${r.text.length}B`);\n      } catch (e) { errors.push(`direct: ${e.message}`); }\n\n      // T1.5：系统浏览器无头渲染（执行 JS 过挑战，抓直连拿不到的页面；无浏览器或设置里关掉时跳过）\n      const browserPath = findSystemBrowser();\n      if (browserEnabled() && browserPath) {\n        try {\n          const html = await browserDumpDom(browserPath, url, { signal });\n          if (html && html.length >= T1_MIN_CHARS && !/403 Forbidden|\\bcaptcha\\b/i.test(html.slice(0, 3000))) {\n            return { url, statusCode: 200, body: { kind: \"html\", content: stripLoneSurrogates(html) }, truncated: false };\n          }\n          errors.push(html ? `browser: short or challenge page (${html.length}B)` : \"browser: no output (timeout or launch failure)\");\n        } catch (e) {\n          errors.push(`browser: ${e.message}`);\n        }\n      }\n\n      // T2/T3：exa 与 firecrawl 的先后顺序可在设置页切换；crawl4ai 固定最后